---
import { sitePath } from '../lib/site';
---

<section class="website-offer" id="website-offer" aria-labelledby="website-offer-title">
	<div class="starter-choice">
		<div><p class="eyebrow">Starting a business?</p><h2>A smaller package has its own scope.</h2><p>The starter package is for a new business that needs a small website, business email and essential account setup together. The prices below cover larger or custom website work.</p></div>
		<a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/start-a-business/')}>See the starter package <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
	</div>
	<div class="offer-heading">
		<div><p class="eyebrow">Larger or custom websites</p>
		<h2 id="website-offer-title">Know the cost<br />before we build.</h2></div>
		<a class="text-link" href="#website-terms">Read the ownership and care terms <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
	</div>

	<div class="pricing" aria-label="Website pricing">
		<div class="price-card primary">
			<p class="price-label">Project price</p>
			<p class="price">From <span>A$6,500</span></p>
			<p>Planning, design and writing for up to five core pages, one agreed interactive feature and two review rounds.</p>
			<a href="#consultation-form">Discuss a website project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
		</div>
		<div class="price-card managed">
			<p class="price-label">Managed payment option</p>
			<p class="price"><span>A$1,490</span> upfront</p>
			<p class="monthly">then A$299 a month for 24 months from launch</p>
			<p class="total"><span>A$8,666</span> minimum total including the upfront payment</p>
			<p>Build and defined care included. Available by written proposal.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<p class="offer-currency">All prices are in AUD. GST is not currently charged. The proposal confirms timing once the scope, content, access and review process are understood.</p>

	<div class="offer-disclosures" id="website-terms">
		<section><h3>What the custom scope includes</h3><ul><li>One planning workshop and a written project scope</li><li>Custom structure, design and writing for up to five core pages</li><li>One focused interactive feature with agreed inputs and outputs</li><li>Two consolidated review rounds</li><li>Search and analytics setup, enquiry testing, launch and handover</li></ul></section>
		<section><h3>Managed care limits</h3><p>Where included in the proposal, managed care covers hosting, backups, monitoring, scheduled form checks, up to 30 minutes of small edits each month and a quarterly review. Unused edit time does not roll over. New pages, redesigns, new features, content production and urgent or after-hours work need a separate quote. Monitoring does not include a staffed 24-hour response. After 24 months, choose handover to your own hosting or ask for a separately quoted care arrangement.</p></section>
		<section><h3>Website ownership and handover</h3><p>Your domain and business accounts stay in your name. Once the agreed project payments are complete, you receive the website files and the final content created for your project. Third-party software, fonts, images and services remain subject to their own licences. The proposal records any exceptions and the process for cancellation or early handover before work starts.</p></section>
		<section><h3>Work that needs a separate quote</h3><p>Online shops, customer accounts, complex booking systems, external integrations and larger data-backed tools sit outside the starting scope. Large content migrations, photography, logo work, legal writing and third-party fees are also quoted separately when needed.</p></section>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
 .website-offer { padding-block:var(--section-space); border-top:1px solid var(--seam); box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 var(--edge); }
 .starter-choice{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.3fr) minmax(12rem,.7fr);align-items:end;gap:2rem;margin-bottom:var(--section-space);padding:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.5rem);background:var(--plastic);border:1px solid var(--line)}
 .starter-choice h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem)}.starter-choice p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:46rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}.starter-choice .text-link{justify-self:end}
 .offer-heading { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:2rem; align-items:start; margin-bottom:3rem; }
 .offer-heading .text-link { font-size:.95rem; }
 .pricing { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1.25rem; }
 .price-card { padding:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.5rem); border:1px solid var(--line); background-color:var(--plastic); }
 .price-card.managed { background-color:var(--plastic); }
 .price-card p { color:var(--muted); font-size:1rem; line-height:1.65; }
 .price-card .price-label { margin:0 0 1rem; color:var(--ink); font-weight:700; font-size:1.2rem; }
 .price-card .price { margin:0; color:var(--ink); font-size:1.3rem; font-weight:700; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-.04em; }
 .price span { font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4.1vw,4rem); letter-spacing:-.04em; }
 .price-card .monthly { color:var(--ink); font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:700; }
 .price-card .total { margin-top:.6rem; color:var(--ink); }
 .price-card a { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:1.5rem; min-height:44px; margin-top:1rem; font-weight:700; }
 .offer-currency { font-size:.9rem; color:var(--muted); }
 .offer-exclusions { margin-top:2rem; padding-top:1.5rem; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
 .offer-exclusions p { color:var(--muted); }
 .offer-disclosures { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:0 3rem; margin-top:2rem; }
 .offer-disclosures section { padding:1.5rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
 .offer-disclosures h3 { margin:0 0 .8rem; font-size:1.1rem; }
 .offer-disclosures p,.offer-disclosures ul { margin:0 0 1.5rem; font-size:1rem; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; }
 .offer-disclosures li+li { margin-top:.5rem; }
 @media(max-width:760px) { .starter-choice{grid-template-columns:1fr}.starter-choice .text-link{justify-self:start}.offer-heading{display:block}.offer-heading .text-link{margin-top:1.5rem}.pricing,.offer-disclosures{grid-template-columns:1fr}.price-card{padding:1.5rem} }
</style>
